    {
      "id": "u_b9c40d996291f95d0049a9a5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Trilium's core feature is the ability to structure your notes into hierarchical tree-like structure.",
      "sourceHash": "b9c40d996291f95d0049a9a52ef4ecc8bfa0cb400d4b3aeaefe22bec67bb2061",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Motivation",
      "contextHash": "ef7a987b8b26daba7a4e897731622e58f856f900fbc386aabd785c21728ed4a7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Triliumのコア機能は、ノートを階層的なツリー状の構造に整理できる点です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3879e39a48c6f94081556a48_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "It is expected then that you'll have an elaborate and deep note hierarchy - each subtree will represent a more refined and specialized view of your knowledge base.",
      "sourceHash": "3879e39a48c6f94081556a4830338c3769445f40bb553fc81d7df9bb8892b52a",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Motivation",
      "contextHash": "ef7a987b8b26daba7a4e897731622e58f856f900fbc386aabd785c21728ed4a7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "そのため、複雑で深いノート階層を持つことが想定されます。各サブツリーは、ナレッジベースのより洗練され特化したビューを表すことになります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b29b51ff1b98ed7bd9dacc96_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "This is a pretty powerful approach, but it also carries a hidden assumption that each \"subtopic\" is \"owned\" by one parent. I'll illustrate this with an example - let's say my basic structure is this:",
      "sourceHash": "b29b51ff1b98ed7bd9dacc96aef5514e8956e71cb63449569ba0da1667ae3671",
      "context": "Cloning Notes > Motivation",
      "contextHash": "ef7a987b8b26daba7a4e897731622e58f856f900fbc386aabd785c21728ed4a7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "これは非常に強力なアプローチですが、同時に、各「サブトピック」は1つの親に「所有されている」という暗黙の前提も抱えています。例を使ってこれを説明しましょう。私の基本構造が次のようになっているとします。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
